<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-21994] Broken link to Monitoring Rebalancing Process</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-21994</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The following documentation topic &lt;a href=&quot;http://https://ignite.apache.org/docs/latest/data-rebalancing#monitoring-rebalancing-process&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Monitoring Rebalancing Process&lt;/a&gt; contains an incorrect link that leads to a non-existent page: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ignite.apache.org/docs/latest/monitoring-metrics/metrics#monitoring-rebalancing&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ignite.apache.org/docs/latest/monitoring-metrics/metrics#monitoring-rebalancing&lt;/a&gt; (perhaps this page was moved or deleted).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think we can use &lt;a href=&quot;https://ignite.apache.org/docs/latest/monitoring-metrics/new-metrics#caches&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ignite.apache.org/docs/latest/monitoring-metrics/new-metrics#caches&lt;/a&gt; where the rebalance metrics are described.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
